OL,3,AReform faces questions over candidate
OL,4,Avetting after undercover filming
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also shows a former Reform candidate
OL,7,Fclaiming he failed the party's vetting
OL,8,Fprocess twice but was still allowed to
OL,9,Fstand to be a councillor. Reform denies
OL,10,Fthe individual failed vetting in the
OL,11,Ffirst place.
OL,13,FReform said the party had "improved and
OL,14,Fprioritised its vetting procedures".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
